{"schemaVersion":1,"id":52,"sections":[{"id":"118007-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[1750],"start":0,"count":42},{"id":"118007-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[11740],"start":42,"count":18},{"id":"118008-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[1760],"start":60,"count":40},{"id":"118008-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[11750],"start":100,"count":14},{"id":"118009-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[1770],"start":114,"count":14},{"id":"118009-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[11760],"start":128,"count":11}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:2","scriptId":1750,"text":"阳光穿过窗户射入寝室，预示着新的一天开始了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:3","scriptId":1750,"text":"穿着好死水制服，看看窗外，在出发之前脑袋里整理了一下思绪。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:4","scriptId":1750,"text":"（距离加入死水也已经二个多月了，死水的运作方式我已经稔熟于心，工作起来轻松愉快。）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:5","scriptId":1750,"text":"死水佣兵体系自成一派，除了特定的征召任务以外，大多数时间都可以自由分配，但是每个月必须完成固定数量的任务。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:6","scriptId":1750,"text":"（回想起来，刚加入的第一个月，光是要完成指定的任务数量就已经精疲力尽了……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:7","scriptId":1750,"text":"这时，听到有敲门声。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:8","scriptId":1750,"text":"我看了看表，七点零五分。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:9","scriptId":1750,"text":"“恩，还是一样的准时啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:10","scriptId":1750,"text":"我整了整衣领便走去开门。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:11","scriptId":1750,"text":"打开门，和预想的一样，一个熟悉的娇小身影出现在门口。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:12","scriptId":1750,"text":"“长官，已经到集合时间了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:13","scriptId":1750,"text":"佐伊的妹妹——佩妮，目前担任小队的联络核心，东奔西跑的事情都由她来处理；勤劳守时，认真负责，没有比她更适合当副官的人选了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:14","scriptId":1750,"text":"“哦～很准时啊，提前十五分钟就来了，每次都这样，真是有劳你了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":588,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:15","scriptId":1750,"text":"“没什么，这是我应该做的，那么我们走吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":588,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:18","scriptId":1750,"text":"一路穿梭在死水基地那错综复杂的通道中，不过因为已经轻车熟路，所以很快就来到了我们的集合地点——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:19","scriptId":1750,"text":"在一张小桌子前另两位钢舞姬正在等待我们的到来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":574,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:20","scriptId":1750,"text":"“哟吼～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":574,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":592,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:21","scriptId":1750,"text":"“早上好。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":574,"right":592,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":578,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:22","scriptId":1750,"text":"“今天我们可没有迟到～准备起飞了吗～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":578,"right":592,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:23","scriptId":1750,"text":"奈特莉在成为钢舞姬之前是名空中小姐，漂亮能干还非常有亲和力，不过真不知道这是性格使然还是受之前的职业影响。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":578,"right":592,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:24","scriptId":1750,"text":"和神采奕奕的奈特莉相比，一旁的维卡只是淡淡地对我和佩妮问候了一声。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":578,"right":592,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:25","scriptId":1750,"text":"“早上好。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":578,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:26","scriptId":1750,"text":"“恩，维卡，早上好。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:27","scriptId":1750,"text":"（大家的精神状态都不错嘛。）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:28","scriptId":1750,"text":"“咳哼……今天大家都挺早的，那么我们就去芮蓓那里看看有什么委托任务吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:30","scriptId":1750,"text":"到了任务前台，就看见一身蓝色军装的芮蓓笑容可掬地站在前台。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:31","scriptId":1750,"text":"“您好～今天是来挑选任务的吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:32","scriptId":1750,"text":"“是的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:33","scriptId":1750,"text":"“好的，这是今天的委托列表～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:34","scriptId":1750,"text":"把委托列表交给我之后，芮蓓凑上来小声地对我说道。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:35","scriptId":1750,"text":"“早上更新了两份紧急委托，都是报酬非常丰厚的哟～趁现在还没什么人……”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:36","scriptId":1750,"text":"“哦？我看看……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:37","scriptId":1750,"text":"死水内部关于接受任务的规定并没有很详细规定，纯粹的先到先得，所有偶尔也会发生一些任务受理方面的纠纷，这种时候会有仲裁人员出来判定。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:38","scriptId":1750,"text":"我立刻扫了一眼，果然，表单最后有两项新追加出来的任务。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:39","scriptId":1750,"text":"“哦！？都是五百万的报酬！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:40","scriptId":1750,"text":"“长官说得太大声了……让我们看看。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:41","scriptId":1750,"text":"佩妮从我手中拿过列表，奈特莉和维卡也围上来观望，不过很快就从她们那里传来了叹气声。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":577,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:42","scriptId":1750,"text":"“唉……第一个是搜索任务啊，还是撒哈拉沙漠……非常耗费时间，性价比很差的说……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":577,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":589,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:43","scriptId":1750,"text":"“第二个也好不到哪去，剿灭战车兽虽然是比较方便的，但是地理位置有点远……是亚洲……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":577,"right":589,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":577,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:44","scriptId":1750,"text":"“距离到还好说，主要这个任务的限制时间很紧，不能按时完成任务的话……违约金可不少……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":577,"right":589,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:45","scriptId":1750,"text":"（既然她们都这么说了，那就只能看看别的了……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":577,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-PROLOGUE:1750:46","scriptId":1750,"text":"“那我们就接别的任务吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":577,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-EPILOGUE:11740:1","scriptId":11740,"text":"“恩，干得不错，收工吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118007-EPILOGUE:11740:2","scriptId":11740,"text":"最后还是挑选了一个简单的任务，报酬虽然少一点，但是好在能快速完成。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-EPILOGUE:11740:3","scriptId":11740,"text":"“这个完成了的话，这个月还剩一个任务就完成指定数量了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-EPILOGUE:11740:4","scriptId":11740,"text":"“是的。不过就目前的报酬来说，马马虎虎，因为都是些低报酬的保底任务。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118007-EPILOGUE:11740:5","scriptId":11740,"text":"除去舞装的保养费用，炮弹的补给费用，其实到手也并没有多少钱。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-EPILOGUE:11740:6","scriptId":11740,"text":"“等到佐伊来了的话，可以考虑做点更高级的任务。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":591,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-EPILOGUE:11740:7","scriptId":11740,"text":"“啊，我都忘了这件事了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":591,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-EPILOGUE:11740:8","scriptId":11740,"text":"“快了吧，也就一个月左右的功夫了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":591,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":582,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-EPILOGUE:11740:9","scriptId":11740,"text":"“不过真的能增加战斗力吗～看佩妮的评价好像不怎么高啊～虽然是她姐姐的说～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":582,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-EPILOGUE:11740:10","scriptId":11740,"text":"“呃……是有一点脱线……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":582,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":574,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-EPILOGUE:11740:11","scriptId":11740,"text":"“当然了，撇开战斗能力不说，我是很期待见见佐伊的～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":574,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-EPILOGUE:11740:12","scriptId":11740,"text":"“希望……报酬多点……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":596,"right":574,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":578,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-EPILOGUE:11740:13","scriptId":11740,"text":"“这个得看指挥官的～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":596,"right":578,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-EPILOGUE:11740:14","scriptId":11740,"text":"“恩……这个……挑战一下也可以。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":578,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-EPILOGUE:11740:15","scriptId":11740,"text":"“那么本月最后一个任务，我们挑战个高报酬的试试？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":578,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-EPILOGUE:11740:16","scriptId":11740,"text":"“Да！”（俄文：是）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118007-EPILOGUE:11740:17","scriptId":11740,"text":"很少看到维卡这么积极，她的眼中闪烁着光芒……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118007-EPILOGUE:11740:18","scriptId":11740,"text":"“那就这么定了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:2","scriptId":1760,"text":"任务前台——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:3","scriptId":1760,"text":"“今天也是样子，来一些简单容易的任务是吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":596,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:4","scriptId":1760,"text":"“不不，今天的话，我想要几个高报酬的任务。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:5","scriptId":1760,"text":"“恩！高报酬！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":596,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:6","scriptId":1760,"text":"维卡冒了出来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":596,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:7","scriptId":1760,"text":"“正如你所见……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":596,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:8","scriptId":1760,"text":"芮蓓看了看维卡，若有所思的点了点头，然后掏出笔迅速得在任务表单上圈了几下，递给我。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":596,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:9","scriptId":1760,"text":"“我知道了～您看一下，以下几个任务是不是合适？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:10","scriptId":1760,"text":"“好的，我看看……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:11","scriptId":1760,"text":"圈出来的任务有三个——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:12","scriptId":1760,"text":"第一个是协力开发野战口粮","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:13","scriptId":1760,"text":"第二个是波西娅博士的神秘委托……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:14","scriptId":1760,"text":"第三个是从护送要员至莫斯科","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:15","scriptId":1760,"text":"“怎么选呢……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":582,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:16","scriptId":1760,"text":"“哦呀？还没决定好吗？我看看啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":582,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:17","scriptId":1760,"text":"和往常一样，奈特莉又从我手里把任务表拿了过去。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":582,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:18","scriptId":1760,"text":"“恩……除了波西娅博士的那个委托直接跳过以外，协力开发和要员护送看上去都还可以。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":582,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:19","scriptId":1760,"text":"“那个……第一个怎么看也不像是我们能做的。芮蓓能说明一下吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":584,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:20","scriptId":1760,"text":"“好的～这个任务其实不是要求你们去研发口粮，而是试口粮啦～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":584,"right":11,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":591,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:21","scriptId":1760,"text":"“试吃？那应该挺方便的，就选这个吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":591,"right":11,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:22","scriptId":1760,"text":"“是吗？不过危险系数不低的说，虽说有一定的医疗保障，但是也可能出现食物中毒等情况……最坏的话……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":591,"right":11,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":582,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:23","scriptId":1760,"text":"“最坏的话？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":582,"right":11,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:24","scriptId":1760,"text":"“可能会导致死亡……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":582,"right":11,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":574,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:25","scriptId":1760,"text":"“啊呀，这可是有点危险呢～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":574,"right":11,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":591,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:26","scriptId":1760,"text":"“恩……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":574,"right":591,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:27","scriptId":1760,"text":"“显而易见……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":596,"right":591,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:28","scriptId":1760,"text":"维卡伸出那细小的手指，在任务表上点了点。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":596,"right":591,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:29","scriptId":1760,"text":"“好吧……既然口粮任务的风险有点高，那么我们就选护送——”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":596,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:30","scriptId":1760,"text":"“哦呀～竟然连看都不看就否决了我这个高报酬的任务呢～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:31","scriptId":1760,"text":"“啊～是波西娅博士～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":608,"right":11,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:32","scriptId":1760,"text":"“！！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:33","scriptId":1760,"text":"回头一看，波西娅正站在佩妮她们旁边……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:34","scriptId":1760,"text":"“您怎么在这里啊……那个……我的意思是您的任务肯定有更合适的人选，对我们这种新近小队来说，您的任务比较有难度……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:35","scriptId":1760,"text":"“啊～这样啊～也对呢，本来想说如果你们接了这个任务的话，佐伊的舞装更换费用我就免掉一半的说……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:36","scriptId":1760,"text":"“什么！？那个……您能说得更具体一点吗？？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":594,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:37","scriptId":1760,"text":"“姐姐的改造？？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":594,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":578,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:38","scriptId":1760,"text":"“听上去像是个大新闻啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":578,"right":594,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:39","scriptId":1760,"text":"“舞装改造……费用庞大……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":578,"right":596,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:40","scriptId":1760,"text":"“那就得看你们的行动咯～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":608,"right":596,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-PROLOGUE:1760:41","scriptId":1760,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118008-EPILOGUE:11750:1","scriptId":11750,"text":"波西娅博士的研究室——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118008-EPILOGUE:11750:2","scriptId":11750,"text":"最终我们还是接下了波西娅博士的任务……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-EPILOGUE:11750:3","scriptId":11750,"text":"“那我先说下任务咯～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-EPILOGUE:11750:4","scriptId":11750,"text":"“愿闻其详……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-EPILOGUE:11750:5","scriptId":11750,"text":"“不要那么紧张啦～不是什么大不了的任务～要你们去接个人而已。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-EPILOGUE:11750:6","scriptId":11750,"text":"“接人？具体的情况呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-EPILOGUE:11750:7","scriptId":11750,"text":"“我的妹妹尤拉～。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-EPILOGUE:11750:8","scriptId":11750,"text":"“诶？那您的妹妹也是钢舞姬吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-EPILOGUE:11750:9","scriptId":11750,"text":"“对，因为她的舞装发生了点问题，所以你们要去接应一下。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-EPILOGUE:11750:10","scriptId":11750,"text":"“就那么简单？……这报酬好像很高的样子。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-EPILOGUE:11750:11","scriptId":11750,"text":"“哦呀，挺精明嘛～确实还有个附加条件。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-EPILOGUE:11750:12","scriptId":11750,"text":"“但说无妨。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118008-EPILOGUE:11750:13","scriptId":11750,"text":"“嘻嘻嘻～具体情况是这样的……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118008-EPILOGUE:11750:14","scriptId":11750,"text":"波西娅的脸上浮现了‘天真无邪’的笑容。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118009-PROLOGUE:1770:2","scriptId":1770,"text":"根据波西娅的指示，我们很快就动身赶往她妹妹尤拉的所在地域。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118009-PROLOGUE:1770:3","scriptId":1770,"text":"波西娅给出的坐标位置极其精确，就像是定位一样，我们非常简单地就找到了那个被称为尤拉的钢舞姬。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118009-PROLOGUE:1770:4","scriptId":1770,"text":"“那个就是尤拉了吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":4,"right":4,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118009-PROLOGUE:1770:5","scriptId":1770,"text":"我拿着望远镜看向正在远处废墟。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":4,"right":4,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118009-PROLOGUE:1770:6","scriptId":1770,"text":"废墟中站着一位楚楚动人的少女，服装非常华丽，当然身上的那套舞装也非常庞大，看上去让人敬畏三分。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":4,"right":4,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118009-PROLOGUE:1770:8","scriptId":1770,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":null,"right":728,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118009-PROLOGUE:1770:9","scriptId":1770,"text":"这位少女正在废墟中摸索着什么。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":null,"right":728,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118009-PROLOGUE:1770:11","scriptId":1770,"text":"“没错，就是她了。那接下来怎么办？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":584,"right":null,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118009-PROLOGUE:1770:12","scriptId":1770,"text":"“还能怎么样……就这么看着呗，波西娅的附加条件你也听到了，不到最后的时候绝对不出手帮助尤拉。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":584,"right":4,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":582,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118009-PROLOGUE:1770:13","scriptId":1770,"text":"“唉～真是个奇怪的任务～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":582,"right":4,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118009-PROLOGUE:1770:14","scriptId":1770,"text":"(这个附加条件还真是有点坏心眼啊……)","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":582,"right":4,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118009-PROLOGUE:1770:15","scriptId":1770,"text":"“不过这也不代表我们没有事情做了，这周边的战车兽比想象中的要多，我们得先想办法清理掉一点。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":582,"right":4,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118009-PROLOGUE:1770:16","scriptId":1770,"text":"“长官的意思是在不被发现的情况下悄悄地削减周边战车兽的数量？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":584,"right":4,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118009-PROLOGUE:1770:17","scriptId":1770,"text":"“正是。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":584,"right":4,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118009-EPILOGUE:11760:0","scriptId":11760,"text":"过去了两天。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":584,"right":4,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118009-EPILOGUE:11760:2","scriptId":11760,"text":"虽然有不少战车兽被我们清理掉了，但还是有不小的规模。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":584,"right":4,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118009-EPILOGUE:11760:3","scriptId":11760,"text":"根据观察，要守护的目标——尤拉已经抵御了十几批战车兽的进攻。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":584,"right":4,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118009-EPILOGUE:11760:4","scriptId":11760,"text":"“我想差不多了，看上去尤拉那边的补给要耗尽了吧，我们应该可以过去‘接’她了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":4,"right":4,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":591,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118009-EPILOGUE:11760:5","scriptId":11760,"text":"“长官，波西娅的要求是不到最后关头不出手。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":4,"right":591,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118009-EPILOGUE:11760:6","scriptId":11760,"text":"“这……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":4,"right":591,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":582,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118009-EPILOGUE:11760:7","scriptId":11760,"text":"“长官，那么急着英雄救美吗～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":4,"right":582,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118009-EPILOGUE:11760:8","scriptId":11760,"text":"“啊……我并没那个意思……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":4,"right":582,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":574,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118009-EPILOGUE:11760:9","scriptId":11760,"text":"“哈哈～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":4,"right":574,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118009-EPILOGUE:11760:10","scriptId":11760,"text":"“那么继续待机……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":4,"right":574,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118009-EPILOGUE:11760:11","scriptId":11760,"text":"“Да。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":596,"right":574,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
